Package: iavf-dkms
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: all
Maintainer: cmspam <cmspam@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: dkms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: Intel out-of-tree iavf VF driver (DKMS)
 Builds the Intel ethernet-linux-iavf module via DKMS against the running
 kernel. Keeps the pre-page-pool RX queue-config ABI required by some
 hypervisor PF drivers (e.g. VMware ESXi i40en) on kernels 6.10 and newer.
 Selected over the in-kernel iavf via a depmod override.
